{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","泼水游戏"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","恢复周围友军生命，使周围敌人进入睡眠状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","用木舀向周围2格区域泼洒温泉水，使命中的友军恢复120% + 10% ATK生命值，对命中的敌人造成140% + 15% ATK伤害并使其进入持续1秒的睡眠状态，睡眠状态下无法行动，目标此前每累计受到相当于其最大生命值10%的治疗效果，或者每累计受到3次来自自身创造温泉区域的治疗，该睡眠状态延长0.5秒，至多延长至3秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":50,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至170% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至180% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","温泉水疗"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时向前跳跃，打断周围敌人行动并创造温泉区域。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时向前跳跃最多3格，猛踩地面打通泉眼，对周围1格敌军造成200% + 20% ATK伤害并附带打断效果，随后使自身周围2格被覆盖为温泉区域，处于温泉区域的友军每秒恢复25% + 2% ATK生命值，处于温泉区域的敌人每秒恢复4% ATK的生命（不超过该敌人0.5%最大生命值）。技能施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":90,"end":95,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":116,"end":122,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":151,"end":153,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至260% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","巨力猛击"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","猛击敌人造成眩晕，同时自身获得一定护盾。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用木舀猛击敌人，造成150% + 10% ATK伤害并使目标眩晕1.5秒，同时自身获得340% + 30% ATK的护盾持续8秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":48,"end":54,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],[